OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChannel 4 documentary and journalists
OL,4,A'poisoned the well' against Russell
OL,5,ABrand, court hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand faces seven counts; three counts
OL,8,Fof rape, three charges of sexual
OL,9,Fassault and one allegation of attempted
OL,10,Findecent assault.
OL,12,FHe denies all the allegations.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
